sequenceDiagram
    participant App as MainActivity
    participant F as DOFLogUtil
    participant H as LogHelper
    participant Fmt as AndroidLogFormat
    participant Cat as AndroidLogAdapter
    participant Disk as DiskLogAdapter
    participant Plugin as PluginDiskLogAdapter
    participant Sys as android.util.Log
    participant File as 本地 txt

    App->>F: d(TAG, msg)
    F->>H: d(TAG, msg)
    H->>H: 级别 DEBUG, 组装 text
    H->>Cat: filter 通过
    Cat->>Fmt: format(model, tag, msg)
    Fmt-->>Cat: [时间][tag][文件][行号]...
    Cat->>Sys: Log.println
    H->>Disk: filter 通过
    Disk->>Fmt: format
    Disk->>File: HandlerThread 异步 append
    H->>Plugin: tag 不是 weex/h5/plugin
    Note over Plugin: filter 失败, 不写
